  <metadata>
    <name>RI-06 · Highway 31 / Trout Lake</name>
    <desc>Meadow Creek–Gerrard–Trout Lake connector; wide at first, then narrow one-lane road with hairpins and logging traffic. Road geometry derived from OpenStreetMap contributors under ODbL; route selection is an independently authored research overview. Verify land access, closures, gates, weather and field signage.</desc>
